or</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#f1d4d5;\">Five categories, one supplier, all professional-grade.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body copy -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:28px 36px 8px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:23px; color:#1a1a1a;\">\n              Most people find us looking for one specific part. Here's the rest of what we carry, so you know where to come back to next time.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Category 1: DC Power -->\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"p-24\" style=\"padding:22px 28px 0 28px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"cat-col\" width=\"35%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 16px 0 0;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/product-category/dc-power-products/charge-convert/battery-chargers/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                      <img class=\"prodimg\" src=\"https://www.12voltpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/DC-10-LFP_Label.png\" width=\"160\" alt=\"DC-10A-LFP 10A LFP Battery Charger\" style=\"display:block; width:160px; max-width:160px; height:auto; border:1px solid #e2e2e2;\">\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"cat-col\" width=\"65%\" valign=\"top\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b71f23;\">Category 1 of 5</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#000000;\">DC Power Products</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; fo